  "ending": {
    "unlockAfter": 3,
    "acts": [
      {
        "image": "images/arnolfini.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "扬·凡·艾克《阿尔诺芬尼夫妇像》1434，伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "Jan van Eyck, The Arnolfini Portrait, 1434, The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1434年 · 伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "1434 · The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT I",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第一幕 · 布鲁日的一个房间",
          "en": "A room in Bruges"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1434年，凡·艾克画下了这对夫妇。男人被认为是富有的意大利商人乔瓦尼·阿尔诺芬尼，站在他布鲁日家中的会客室里，旁边的女人可能是他的第二任妻子。这幅双人像到底要表达什么，至今仍有争论。",
          "en": "In 1434, Van Eyck painted this couple. The man is believed to be the wealthy Italian merchant Giovanni Arnolfini, in the reception room of his house in Bruges, possibly with his second wife. What the double portrait is meant to show is still debated."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/arnolfini.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "扬·凡·艾克《阿尔诺芬尼夫妇像》1434，伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "Jan van Eyck, The Arnolfini Portrait, 1434, The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1434年 · 伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "1434 · The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT II",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第二幕 · 一个“真实”的房间",
          "en": "A \"real\" room"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "这个房间逼真得就像画家只是拆掉了一面墙。但仔细看，它有矛盾：吊灯的空间不够，也没有壁炉。凡·艾克画的是一个看起来真实的房间，而不一定是真实的记录。",
          "en": "The room looks so real, it is as if Van Eyck had simply removed a wall. Yet there are inconsistencies: not enough space for the chandelier, and no fireplace. He built a convincing room, not necessarily a record of a real one."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/arnolfini.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "扬·凡·艾克《阿尔诺芬尼夫妇像》1434，伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "Jan van Eyck, The Arnolfini Portrait, 1434, The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1434年 · 伦敦国家美术馆",
          "en": "1434 · The National Gallery, London"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT III",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第三幕 · 来到伦敦",
          "en": "In London"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "这幅画的大部分历史都在西班牙度过。1842年，伦敦国家美术馆在政府资助下买下了它，这是国家美术馆收藏的第一幅北方文艺复兴作品。今天，它挂在52号展厅。",
          "en": "The painting spent much of its history in Spain. In 1842, the National Gallery bought it with a government grant: its first Northern Renaissance painting. Today it hangs in Room 52."
        }
      }
    ],
    "final": {
      "zh": "扬·凡·艾克来过这里。",
      "en": "Jan van Eyck was here."
    },
